+ *   shared uninstall-batch path.
+ *
+ * Owned by: pimSFXCopier (pim_core/includes/pimSFXCopier.h), a process-wide
+ * singleton (GetInstance()) -- NOT a per-entitlement object. Only one SFX
+ * install can be in flight across the whole process at a time.
